    {
      "title": "Events Processed Rate",
      "description": "Events processed per second through the full webhook handler flow, broken down by status (success, error). This shows the real-time ingestion throughput. A drop in success rate with rising error rate indicates downstream issues (NATS publish failures, payload validation errors).",
