    {
      "title": "Payload Size Distribution",
      "description": "Distribution of incoming webhook body sizes across histogram buckets. Helps identify unusually large payloads that may cause memory pressure or slow processing. Most IoT payloads should be under 1KB; large outliers may indicate misconfigured devices or bulk uploads.",
