    {
      "title": "Avg Payload Size",
      "description": "Average incoming webhook body size over the last 5 minutes. Green is normal (<10KB), yellow indicates larger-than-expected payloads (10-50KB), red means oversized payloads (>50KB) that may stress memory and serialization.",
